    "Predict the electron-domain geometry (linear, trigonal planar, tetrahedral, trigonal bipyramidal, octahedral) from the steric number.",
    "Distinguish electron-domain geometry from molecular geometry and identify the shape produced when domains are lone pairs.",
    "Explain why lone pairs occupy more angular space than bonding pairs and predict the direction of bond-angle deviations.",
    "Apply VSEPR predictions to real molecules and compare to experimentally observed structures."
